/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The New Business Registration \(NewBizReg\) Portal is an alternative option in submitting application to the Bureau of Internal Revenue \(BIR\) for registration of new businesses \(Head Office and Branch\). Taxpayer-applicants shall prepare all scanned copy of required documents to be attached and to be submitted via email through this Portal to the concerned BIR Revenue District Office \(RDO\). The NewBizReg Portal can be accessed in the BIR Website \(www.bir.gov.ph\) under the eServices tab/Other eServices icon.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [13]
>>
