/T (Note:   Under the Ease of Paying Taxes Act \(EOPT\) otherwise know as the Republic Act 11976, taxpayers are required to file their tax returns electronically and pay their taxes, either electronically or manually, with any Authorized Agent Bank, Revenue District Office \(through its Revenue Collection Officers\), Payment gateways  or Authorized Tax Software Provider.  This gives taxpayers the flexibility in filing and paying their taxes anywhere without worries of incurring administrative penalties for filing at the wrong venue.)
